WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,020
The Huo family was brought down by you, Ning.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,020
I hope those here

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,620
Will not be deaf and blind in the same way

4
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,060
full of nonsense

5
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,470
It's impossible for him to bring down the Huo family

6
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:14,890
It's absolutely impossible not to believe it

7
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:15,890
Then try it

8
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,090
Wait don't

9
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:19,040
The Su family will never bother you again

10
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:23,040
Lu Tingfeng is

11
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,840
The Lu family will never disturb you

12
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,720
I hope you all take good care of yourself

13
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:30,800
Otherwise, you'll be responsible for the consequences. I'll send it to you. You don't have to.

14
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,160
Happy wedding to you

15
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,050
Waiting to return to Xizhou

16
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,450
He won't be happy anymore

17
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:38,290
I'll take you wherever you go

18
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,290
Do you have time to play together?

19
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:40,250
No need, no time

20
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,810
Then add your contact information and remember it

21
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:44,830
Hello, I am Meng Qiong

22
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,310
According to blood origin, she is your cousin.

23
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,870
Then don’t count it based on blood source

24
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,060
Okay, then call me Meng Qiong

25
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,080
Master Qi
